# Copy to .env for local dev (`expo start`). These are the real values for
# the project this repo is wired to (tqkmpirusmdckccqfxyd) -- safe to have
# here since EXPO_PUBLIC_ values are bundled into the client either way,
# protected by Row Level Security, not by secrecy. If you point this repo at
# a different Supabase project, replace both with that project's own values
# (Project Settings > API). The service role key is a different matter: it
# must NEVER be prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ or added here. See backend/README.md.
#
# Production builds (`expo export`, the GitHub Pages deploy) don't need this
# file -- they load the committed .env.production automatically.

